@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    ViewData["Description"] = "How Palm Engineering handles personal information under the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).";
}

<article class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-17">17 November 2026</time></p>

    <p>
        This policy explains how @Biz.LegalName t/a @Biz.TradingName ("we", "us") handles personal information
        in line with the Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA). Our website is an information site:
        it has no accounts, no online shop and no forms that collect your details.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>
    <address>
        <strong>@Biz.LegalName</strong> t/a @Biz.TradingName<br />
        Registration No @Biz.RegistrationNumber<br />
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Biz.VatNumber))
        {
            <text>VAT No @Biz.VatNumber<br /></text>
        }
        @Biz.FullAddress<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:@Biz.Email">@Biz.Email</a><br />
        Phone: <a href="tel:@BusinessInfo.Tel(Biz.PreferredPhone)">@Biz.PreferredPhone</a><br />
        Information Officer: @Biz.InformationOfficerName
    </address>

    <h2>2. What information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Through this website:</strong> we do not ask you for any personal information. Like most web servers, our hosting records technical request data (such as IP address, browser type, pages requested and time) in server logs. We use these logs only to keep the site secure and working.</li>
        <li><strong>When you contact us:</strong> if you phone, email or visit us, we receive the details you choose to give us, such as your name, contact details and the details of your enquiry.</li>
        <li><strong>Gallery shortlist:</strong> if you use the "Save" button in the gallery, your choices are stored in your own browser (local storage). They are not sent to us. If you click "Email us about these", they are only included in an email that you send yourself.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Why we use information</h2>
    <p>
        We use the information you give us to respond to your enquiry, prepare quotations, supply goods and services,
        keep business and tax records, and meet our legal obligations. We use server logs to protect the website.
        We do not use your information for marketing unless you have asked us to, and we do not sell it.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>
        This website does not set cookies. It does not use analytics, advertising or tracking tools, and it loads no
        third-party scripts, fonts or embedded content. The only data stored in your browser is the optional gallery
        shortlist described above, which you can remove at any time using "Clear" or by clearing your browser data.
        Because nothing non-essential is stored, there is no cookie banner.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Who we share information with</h2>
    <p>
        We share personal information only where needed: with service providers who help us run our business
        (for example our website host and email provider), with professional advisers, and where the law requires it.
        These providers may only use the information to provide their service to us.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security and retention</h2>
    <p>
        We take reasonable technical and organisational steps to protect personal information, including encrypted (HTTPS)
        connections to this website. We keep personal information only for as long as we need it for the purposes above
        or as the law requires, and then delete or de-identify it.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under POPIA you may ask us to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>confirm whether we hold personal information about you and give you a copy;</li>
        <li>correct information that is wrong or out of date;</li>
        <li><strong>delete</strong> or destroy information we no longer have a lawful reason to keep;</li>
        <li>stop using your information for a purpose you object to.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        To make a request, including a data deletion request, email <a href="mailto:@Biz.Email?subject=Data%20request">@Biz.Email</a>
        with the subject "Data request" and tell us what you need. We may ask you to confirm who you are first, and we aim to
        respond within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children</h2>
    <p>
        This website is for businesses and adults and is not directed at children under 18. We do not knowingly collect
        personal information from children. If you believe a child has given us personal information, contact us and we will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Complaints</h2>
    <p>
        If you are unhappy with how we handle your information, please contact us first. You also have the right to complain to the
        Information Regulator (South Africa): <a href="https://inforegulator.org.za" rel="noopener noreferrer">inforegulator.org.za</a>,
        <a href="mailto:complaints.IR@justice.gov.za">complaints.IR@justice.gov.za</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</article>
